•	Create a sample file:
	o	cat > sample.txt <<EOF
	o	The Alchemist — Author: Paulo Coelho
	o	Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone — Author: J. K. Rowling
	o	The Hobbit — Author: J. R. R. Tolkien
	o	Pride and Prejudice — Author: Jane Austen
	o	Wings of Fire — Authors: A. P. J. Abdul Kalam and Arun Tiwari
	o	EOF

•	Add line at top
	./otTextEditor addlinetop book_editors "Famous Books and Editors"

•	Add line at bottom
	./otTextEditor addlineat book_editors 2 " You have inserted me at 2nd line of book editors"

•	Add line at line 2
	./otTextEditor addlineat book_editors 2 "You have inserted me at 2nd line of book editors”

•	Replace first occurrence
	./otTextEditor updatefirstword book_editors Famous Popular

•	Replace all occurrences
	./otTextEditor updateallwords book_editors Author Writer

•	Delete first occurrence of a word
	./otTextEditor deleteword book_editors "Arun Tiwari"

•	Insert word
./otTextEditor insertword book_editors "The Hobbit" "Boomerang"

•	Delete line number 3
./otTextEditor deleteline book_editors 3

•	Delete lines containing "Ubuntu"
./otTextEditor deletelinecontaining book_editors Writer

•	Show file
./otTextEditor show book_editors

•	Count lines
./otTextEditor countlines book_editors

•	Count words
./otTextEditor countwords book_editors

•	Show line numbers
./otTextEditor linenumbers book_editors

